{"version":1,"content":"<p>歌手張崇德日前與粉絲共度生辰，舉行入行以來首個生日音樂會，現場座無虛席。</p><p>張崇德興奮表示：「今次是我首次舉辦生日音樂會，除了香港粉絲外，也有來自內地、澳門、加拿大和澳洲等地粉絲，真的非常開心。</p><p>」</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T13:01:23.447272+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":98,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T12:22:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T05:38:13.356657+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T12:58:25.020297+00:00","content_hash":"b23488d2ffc3ab25c6c672ed1c9f84e6f1c2bc411a9e6f8a73ce264d57521c59","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}